1. The safest automation rule
My swarm needs 4 permission levels.
Level
Name
What it can do
Level 1
Read-only
Scan, analyze, summarize
Level 2
Draft
Write copy, emails, product descriptions, plans
Level 3
Suggest action
Prepare Shopify/Gmail/calendar updates but wait for approval
Level 4
Execute
Publish, send, update, delete, archive
For Melato, once all os properly set up and tests are positives We will start with:
Default mode: Level 1 + Level 2 only.
we will allow specific actions like:
Agent may update product copy only after my approval.
Agent may label emails automatically.
Agent may create drafts, but never send them. (for now, later it will)
Agent may generate daily reports without approval.
